    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever, chills or night sweats</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Dysuria, frequency and urgency for two days; urine orange from rifampin; no visible blood</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Dull suprapubic ache; no nausea, vomiting or abdominal pain elsewhere</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or sputum</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No back or flank pain</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

